## Keyboard Shortcuts

| Shortcut          | Action                           |
| ----------------- | -------------------------------- |
| `⌘/Ctrl + K`      | Command palette                  |
| `⌘/Ctrl + R`      | Re-analyze                       |
| `⌘/Ctrl + 1-9, 0` | Switch tabs                      |
| `?`               | Toggle shortcut help             |
| `+` / `-` / `0`   | Zoom in/out/reset (Architecture) |
| `F`               | Fit diagram to screen            |

